        "original_id": "93fabf82-f4d3-5e06-bafe-1d76804bb747",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joakim Nyström, Kimberly Po-Messerli, Lori McNeil, Amy Frazier, Katie Schlukebir\n- Places: Sweden, United States\n- Events: 1999 Challenge Bell – Doubles\n- Roles: tennis players, defending champions\n\nFacts:\n- Joakim \"Jocke\" Nyström was born on 20 February 1963 and is a former professional tennis player from Sweden.\n- Joakim Nyström reached the top ten in rankings and won 13 singles titles during his professional career.\n- Kimberly Po-Messerli was born on October 20, 1971 and is a former professional tennis player from the United States.\n- At the 1999 Challenge Bell – Doubles, Lori McNeil and Kimberly Po entered as the defending champions.\n- At the 1999 Challenge Bell – Doubles, Amy Frazier and Katie Schlukebir defeated Lori McNeil and Kimberly Po in the quarterfinals.",
